#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of highway"
msgstr "Instalação do highway"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>highway</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>highway</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:79
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_TESTING=OFF         \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON      \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_TESTING=OFF         \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON      \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package does come with a test suite, but it requires <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink>, which is not in "
"BLFS."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote vem com uma suíte de teste, porém ela exige <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink>, que não está no "
"BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:99
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_TESTING=OFF</parameter>: This parameter disables the "
"test suite from being built because <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> is not part of "
"BLFS. Without this parameter, CMake will download this package during the "
"configuration process. If you wish to run the tests, install <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> and then remove "
"this parameter."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_TESTING=OFF</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita a "
"suíte de teste de ser construída porque <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> não faz parte do "
"BLFS. Sem esse parâmetro, CMake baixará esse pacote durante o processo de "
"configuração. Se você desejar executar os testes, instale <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> e, então,remova "
"esse parâmetro."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/highway.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON</parameter>: This parameter enables "
"building shared versions of the libraries instead of static versions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita "
"construir versões compartilhadas das bibliotecas em vez das versões "
"estáticas."

